{"language_code":"eng","language_probability":0.9852191209793091,"text":"[gentle music] This is Seeking Minima. My career went on an upward trajectory the moment I changed a single frame of mind, which is I'm self-employed. Every single one of us is self-employed. It's just a matter of seeing it that way, and when you see yourself as self-employed, you stop being a victim, and you start gaining power over your time. You start saying no to your coworkers and to your boss because your job is to do your job, not to make them happy. Now, I can hear the rebuttals already, but if you're not happy with your job, stop viewing it as an employer/employee relationship and start thinking about your job more like terms between two people who are providing services and paying for services with each other. That's it. This is a negotiation between two independent people, and if you don't like your job, you don't like the terms of your business arrangement with each other because you're always self-employed. That perspective changed everything. Try it out. [upbeat music]","words":[{"text":"[gentle music]","start":0.06,"end":1.66,"type":"audio_event","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.08802908173273635},{"text":" ","start":1.66,"end":1.68,"type":"spacing","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.0006358985556289554},{"text":"This","start":1.74,"end":1.86,"type":"word","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.0006358985556289554},{"text":" ","start":1.86,"end":1.9,"type":"spacing","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-3.576272320060525e-6},{"text":"is","start":1.9,"end":2.02,"type":"word","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-3.576272320060525e-6},{"text":" ","start":2.02,"end":2.04,"type":"spacing","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.00037377048283815384},{"text":"Seeking","start":2.04,"end":2.36,"type":"word","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.00037377048283815384},{"text":" ","start":2.36,"end":2.42,"type":"spacing","speaker_id":"speaker_0","logprob":-0.0017063356935977936},{"text":"